.espice 1
.title "Independent source waveforms"
// Each source drives its own 1k load, so every node shows its waveform.
VP (p 0) vsource pulse(0, 1V, td=1ms, tr=0.1ms, tf=0.1ms, pw=2ms, per=5ms)
VS (s 0) vsource sin(0.5V, 0.5V, freq=1kHz)
VW (w 0) vsource pwl((0, 0), (1ms, 1V), (3ms, 1V), (4ms, 0))
VE (e 0) vsource exp(0, 1V, td1=1ms, tau1=0.5ms, td2=3ms, tau2=0.5ms)
IC (0 c) isource 1mA
RP (p 0) resistor 1k
RS (s 0) resistor 1k
RW (w 0) resistor 1k
RE (e 0) resistor 1k
RC (c 0) resistor 1k
.tran stop=5ms step=10us
